Mbed TLS 3.6.7 (long-term support branch), from
https://github.com/Mbed-TLS/mbedtls/releases/download/mbedtls-3.6.7/mbedtls-3.6.7.tar.bz2
SHA-256 a7e8bcbec0e6f761b4af24f25677626b35f762f68eef79c08677a363212d11f6
Licence: Apache-2.0 OR GPL-2.0-or-later (LICENSE); Pkg takes it under Apache-2.0.

Here: library/, include/ and LICENSE of the release, unchanged, without their
CMake and Makefile build files. Only the AROS builds of Pkg compile it
(tools/build-aros.sh, tools/build-aros-x86_64.sh); macOS, Linux and Windows
use the system's curl for https.

pkg_mbedtls_config.h is Pkg's configuration: a TLS 1.2 and 1.3 client that
verifies certificates, and nothing else. The builds add
-DMBEDTLS_TEST_SW_INET_PTON, since AROS's C library has no inet_pton.

To update: replace library/ and include/ with a newer 3.6.x release's, check
its SHA-256 against the release's own sha256sum file, update the lines above,
and run tests/aros-network.sh, tests/aros-push.sh and tests/native-network.sh.
